  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p>한참 전에 했는데 이제야 올립니다.</p><p>아이들 생각보다 아이디어가 반짝이더라구요~^^</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/996480485BDC203D03\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"960\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"1.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"960\"  id=\"A_996480485BDC203D036561\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99F78E485BDC203E33\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"960\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"2.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"960\"  id=\"A_99F78E485BDC203E33ACC8\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/993697485BDC203E05\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"720\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" data-filename=\"3.jpg\" exif=\"{}\" actualwidth=\"720\"  id=\"A_993697485BDC203E051751\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/99EAA0485BDC203E09\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"960\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vs